    "role": "Qliphothic Calamity (Harab Serapel — Greater)",
    "tier": 4,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A single Scavenger is a menace; the Ashen Horde is a natural disaster. A mobile storm of countless burning ravens acting with one voracious intelligence — the manifestation of a kingdom that fell to its own greed. It descends on whole regions and strips them of life, magic, and treasure, leaving silent grey ash. To be caught inside it is to be torn apart by a thousand fiery beaks while an infinite, cawing hunger swallows your soul.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Harab Serapel, the Ravens of Burning — the Hull of Netzach. What is left of triumph when only the taking remains.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'You cannot fight weather. You can, however, be somewhere else. Strongly recommend somewhere else.'</em></p>",
